      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How would people see the objects in the new world you join if you keep the items? Will they have to download your cashed invintory ontop of your avatar? If so this will slow download times alot, and fill cash much much faster if people love to keep inventory full of random crap, or items for the purpose of filling cash of other users as a method of trolling, or being a nuisance to the next world they connect to. This system would be very cool, if they copy neos system for inventory then it could mitigate this issue. But still players could cram the cash like hell by spawning very large or taxing to download items. This isnt much different than them changing avatars to large or taxing avatars, but would just be more convenient for them to do it as a method of disrupting people.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
