        "like": 3
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "World based inventory is nice and all, but would be solved by simply adding it to a fully working avatar based inventory system. There can just be a folder for different VRChat worlds. The only thing the world would have to do, is make sure the content is offered in the world for each persons inventory.\n\nThis is as old as 2017 and still has no traction. This needs to be the next fundamental step, not a fleeting what if. \n\nI could care LESS about the world based economic system they are trying to push. There is nothing that will convince me to subscribe to a world, that is NOT the content marketplace I was wanting.\n\nIf they want people to spend money, that item better have some permanence.  Like with an avatar based inventory system. =)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
